        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "A security vulnerability has been detected in Tenda F456 1.0.0.5. This impacts the function fromPPTPUserSetting of the file /goform/PPTPUserSetting of the component httpd. Such manipulation of the argument delno leads to buffer overflow. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been disclosed publicly and may be used."
          }
        ],
